==Strategy==
Generally, it is a good idea to wait until the two Kories come out and fight them first before activating the boss, as the oncoming threat from all the enemies can quickly overwhelm you, especially on such a short map. The sheer number of Trolly Bloggers can often get in the way of your other attackers, so utilizing midrange area attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] is crucial to clearing several bloggers at once. Bringing [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attack cats]] is a great idea but are usually much less spammable in nature and won't be able to clear out all the Trolly Bloggers by themselves.

==Trivia==
*In real life, [[wikipedia:Shinjuku Golden Gai|Shinjuku Golden Gai]] is a famous district in Tokyo's Shinjuku ward containing around 300 miniature bars crammed into just six alleys.

